    skos:notation "doc_lucerne" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lucerne"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0012 (Seeds Unenumerated Other Sorts). Attested in: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 246."@en ;
